 966	## 7. Typography Tricks
 967	
 968	### 7.1 Fluid Type with clamp()
 969	
 970	```css
 971	:root {
 972	  /* Fluid type scale — no media queries needed */
 973	  --fs-sm: clamp(0.8rem, 0.7rem + 0.25vw, 0.9rem);
 974	  --fs-base: clamp(1rem, 0.9rem + 0.35vw, 1.125rem);
 975	  --fs-lg: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 0.75vw, 1.75rem);
 976	  --fs-xl: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 1.5vw, 3rem);
 977	  --fs-2xl: clamp(2.5rem, 1.5rem + 3vw, 5rem);
 978	}
 979	
 980	body { font-size: var(--fs-base); }
 981	h1 { font-size: var(--fs-2xl); }
 982	h2 { font-size: var(--fs-xl); }
 983	h3 { font-size: var(--fs-lg); }
 984	small { font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
 985	```
